1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,241
He won't stop crying!

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,140
Rosa. Look at me.

3
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:07,016
Do something! Smile at them!

4
00:00:07,296 --> 00:00:11,594
A smile won't stop a crying baby. Breathing will.

5
00:00:12,144 --> 00:00:18,195
Box breathing. In for four. Hold for four. Out for four. Hold for four.

6
00:00:22,944 --> 00:00:27,842
In... two, three, four. Hold. Now out, slowly.

7
00:00:28,392 --> 00:00:30,461
He stopped. He stopped crying.

8
00:00:35,592 --> 00:00:36,804
Your turn, Gus.

9
00:00:37,084 --> 00:00:39,647
In... two... three... four.

10
00:00:40,197 --> 00:00:40,789
Hello, Carrot.

11
00:00:41,069 --> 00:00:42,278
Carrot doesn't breathe.

12
00:00:42,558 --> 00:00:43,524
He's very good at it.

13
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:49,519
Soldiers and surgeons use it. Calm is a skill. Skills can be taught.

14
00:00:50,069 --> 00:00:55,014
Attention shoppers. Lane three is now open.

15
00:00:55,564 --> 00:00:57,254
The doors are past the checkout.

16
00:00:57,534 --> 00:00:58,243
Of course they are.
